        "jsCode": "// Generate a random number between 10000 and 99999\nconst randomNumber = Math.floor(Math.random() * 90000) + 10000;\n\n// Create the ticket reference starting with \"REQ\"\nconst ticketRef = `REQ${randomNumber}`;\n\n// Return as n8n item\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ticketReference: ticketRef\n    }\n  }\n];"
